<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
    Mirrors the main Sample gallery's menu, so the two do not drift. Every page that
    compiles into this head is reachable from here.

    Omitted, because the csproj excludes them from this head: CameraPage, ChatPage, ChatTemplatePage, DocumentSessionPage, KitchenSinkPage.

    The MenuItem section headers do not render in the flyout on this head today — they are
    kept because they document the grouping and ordering, and cost nothing if it gains
    support. A FlyoutItem holding several ShellContents titles each one, or the group
    repeats the same label once per route.
-->
